{'symbol': 'MAR', 'date': '2019-11-04 20:30:00', 'title': 'MARRIOTT INTERNATIONAL POSTS Q3 EPS OF $1.16', 'text': 'MARRIOTT INTERNATIONAL REPORTS THIRD QUARTER 2019 RESULTS.Q3 ADJUSTED EARNINGS PER SHARE $1.47.Q3 EARNINGS PER SHARE $1.16.Q3 EARNINGS PER SHARE ESTIMATE $1.49 -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.MARRIOTT - FOR FULL YEAR 2019, WE EXPECT CASH RETURNED TO SHAREHOLDERS THROUGH DIVIDENDS AND SHARE REPURCHASES COULD APPROACH $3 BILLION.MARRIOTT - Q3 COMPARABLE SYSTEMWIDE CONSTANT DOLLAR REVPAR ROSE 1.5% WORLDWIDE, 1.9 PERCENT OUTSIDE NORTH AMERICA AND 1.3 PERCENT IN NORTH AMERICA.MARRIOTT - FOR Q4 OF 2019, WE EXPECT COMPARABLE REVPAR ON A CONSTANT DOLLAR BASIS WILL INCREASE 0 TO 1 PERCENT IN NORTH AMERICA.MARRIOTT - QTRLY TOTAL REVENUES $5,284 MILLION VERSUS $5,051 MILLION.MARRIOTT SEES 2020 COMPARABLE SYSTEMWIDE REVPAR ON CONSTANT DOLLAR BASIS WILL BE FLAT TO UP 2% WORLDWIDE WITH INCREASE IN NORTH AMERICA IN MIDDLE OF RANGE.MARRIOTT - ANTICIPATES ITS GLOBAL NET ROOMS GROWTH RATE IN 2020 WILL BE COMPARABLE TO ITS EXPECTATION FOR 2019.MARRIOTT - COMPANY ASSUMES FOURTH QUARTER 2019 GROSS FEE REVENUES WILL TOTAL $960 MILLION TO $970 MILLION.MARRIOTT - ANTICIPATES GLOBAL NET ROOM ADDITIONS OF 5.0 TO 5.25 PERCENT FOR FULL YEAR 2019.MARRIOTT - COMPANY EXPECTS FULL YEAR 2019 GROSS FEE REVENUES WILL TOTAL $3,809 MILLION TO $3,819 MILLION.MARRIOTT - ANTICIPATES FULL YEAR 2019 DILUTED EPS COULD TOTAL $5.87 TO $5.90.MARRIOTT - EXPECTS FULL YEAR 2019 GENERAL, ADMINISTRATIVE, AND OTHER EXPENSES COULD TOTAL $921 MILLION TO $926 MILLION.'}{'symbol': 'MAR', 'date': '2019-11-03 22:30:00', 'title': 'MARRIOTT INTERNATIONAL, INC. PROVIDES EARNINGS GUIDANCE FOR THE FOURTH QUARTER AND FULL YEAR OF 2019', 'text': 'MARRIOTT INTERNATIONAL, INC. PROVIDED EARNINGS GUIDANCE FOR THE FOURTH QUARTER AND YEAR 2019. FOR THE QUARTER, THE COMPANY EXPECTS GROSS FEE REVENUES WILL TOTAL $960 MILLION TO $970 MILLION, A 5% TO 7% INCREASE OVER FOURTH QUARTER 2018 GROSS FEE REVENUES OF $910 MILLION. THE COMPANY EXPECTS OPERATING INCOME OF $715 MILLION TO $730 MILLION. THE COMPANY EXPECTS EARNINGS PER SHARE - DILUTED OF $1.44 TO $1.47. THE COMPANY ANTICIPATES FULL YEAR 2019 DILUTED EPS COULD TOTAL $5.87 TO $5.90, A 5% DECLINE COMPARED TO 2018 ADJUSTED DILUTED EPS OF $6.21. FULL YEAR 2019 GUIDANCE INCLUDES THE $9 MILLION PRE-TAX ($0.02 PER SHARE) ASSET SALE GAIN IN GAINS AND OTHER INCOME, NET, RECOGNIZED IN THE 2019 THIRD QUARTER, BUT DOES NOT INCLUDE ANY GAIN ON THE SALE OF THE ST. REGIS NEW YORK. THE COMPANY EXPECTS OPERATING INCOME OF $2,890 MILLION TO $2,905 MILLION. THE COMPANY EXPECTS GROSS FEE REVENUES OF $3,809 MILLION TO $3,819 MILLION.'}